Mantishack
==========

This repository (https://github.com/deonmenezes/mantishack) is built on
top of OpenAI Codex CLI. It ships the Codex CLI source tree with a
repository-wide rebrand to Mantis AI plus an offensive-AppSec capability
layer — see "Modifications" below for the full provenance disclosure.

